#: ../plugins/index.rst:46
msgid "Plugins management interface"
msgstr "Sučelje za upravljanje dodacima"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:48
msgid "A plugins management interface is provided, you will find it from the dashboard or in the configuration menu. After you have downloaded plugin(s) in Galette ``plugins`` directory, a list will be displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Sučelje za upravljanje dodacima dostupno je na nadzornoj ploči ili u "
"izborniku konfiguracije. Nakon preuzimanja dodataka u Galetteovu mapu "
"``plugins`` prikazuje se popis:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:50
msgid "Plugins management"
msgstr "Upravljanje dodacima"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:55
msgid "If web server has read access to your plugins directory, then you can enable or disable any plugin from the related icon."
msgstr ""
"Ako mrežni poslužitelj ima pristup za čitanje mape dodataka, možete "
"uključiti ili isključiti dodatak odgovarajućom ikonom."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:57
msgid "If plugin requires a database to work, you can play installation and update scripts from the interface."
msgstr ""
"Ako dodatak zahtijeva bazu podataka, iz sučelja možete pokrenuti skripte za "
"instalaciju i nadogradnju."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:59
msgid "Database ACLs will then be checked. Unlike Galette, no information will be asked to you, since all is already available from your current instance."
msgstr ""
"Tada se provjeravaju ovlasti baze podataka. Za razliku od instalacije "
"Galettea, ne traže se novi podaci jer već postoje u trenutnoj instalaciji."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:63
msgid "Each plugin now has its own database version, and is updated on its own. The page lists the active plugins first, then the inactive ones, with the reason why they are inactive."
msgstr ""
"Svaki dodatak sada ima vlastitu verziju baze podataka i nadograđuje se "
"zasebno. Stranica najprije navodi uključene dodatke, a zatim isključene uz "
"razlog."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:65
msgid "An icon next to the name of an inactive plugin tells why it is not active:"
msgstr "Ikona uz naziv isključenog dodatka pokazuje razlog:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:67
msgid "**Not installed**: the plugin needs database tables that have not been created yet. Click on the database icon of the **Actions** column to install them,"
msgstr ""
"**Nije instalirano**: dodatak treba tablice baze koje još nisu stvorene. "
"Kliknite ikonu baze u stupcu **Radnje** za instalaciju,"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:68
msgid "**Need update**: the plugin files are more recent than its database. Click on the database icon to run the update,"
msgstr ""
"**Potrebna je nadogradnja**: datoteke dodatka novije su od njegove baze. "
"Kliknite ikonu baze za nadogradnju,"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:69
msgid "**Explicitly disabled**: the plugin has been disabled from this page, or from the :doc:`command line </command-line>`. Click on the activation icon to enable it again,"
msgstr ""
"**Izričito isključeno**: dodatak je isključen na ovoj stranici ili iz "
":doc:`naredbenog retka </command-line>`. Kliknite ikonu za uključivanje,"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:70
msgid "**Incompatible with current version**: the plugin is made for another version of Galette; look for a more recent version of the plugin,"
msgstr ""
"**Nije kompatibilno s trenutnom verzijom**: dodatak je namijenjen drugoj "
"verziji Galettea; potražite noviju verziju dodatka,"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:71
msgid "**A required file is missing**: the plugin files are incomplete; download the plugin again,"
msgstr ""
"**Nedostaje potrebna datoteka**: datoteke dodatka nisu potpune; ponovno ga "
"preuzmite,"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:72
msgid "**Database version missing**: Galette cannot tell which version of the plugin database is installed."
msgstr ""
"**Nedostaje verzija baze podataka**: Galette ne može utvrditi instaliranu "
"verziju baze dodatka."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:74
msgid "The name of an active plugin opens a window with information about it: version, author, routes and access rights."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na naziv uključenog dodatka otvara se prozor s podacima: verzija, "
"autor, rute i ovlasti pristupa."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:78
msgid "Back up your database before installing or updating a plugin database, as you would before updating Galette itself."
msgstr ""
"Prije instalacije ili nadogradnje baze dodatka izradite sigurnosnu kopiju "
"baze, kao i prije nadogradnje samog Galettea."
